WEBVTT

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.997
MR. PING: This is the secret
panda village? [CHUCKLES]

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.347
No wonder
you keep it a secret.

00:00:14.391 --> 00:00:16.523
If I lived here, I wouldn't tell
anyone either.

00:00:20.048 --> 00:00:21.068
[LI CHUCKLES]

00:00:21.615 --> 00:00:23.008
Now you can "Whoa."

00:00:23.051 --> 00:00:26.490
Whoa!

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:28.927
CUB 1: Let's go!
CUB 2: Over here! Come on!

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.711
[PANDAS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY]

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:40.634
CUB 3: Look over there!

00:00:44.986 --> 00:00:46.366
[GASPS] [PANDAS LAUGHING]

00:00:47.206 --> 00:00:48.729
[ALL GASPING]

00:00:51.689 --> 00:00:52.777
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.854
PO: Oh...

00:00:55.214 --> 00:00:57.782
My turn! My turn!
Come on, faster, faster!

00:00:59.827 --> 00:01:01.089
DIM: Li?

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.222
Everyone! Li's back!

00:01:03.265 --> 00:01:05.267
They're both back! He found his son!

00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:06.408
PANDA: He made it! They're back!

00:01:06.442 --> 00:01:08.053
Li? He found his son!

00:01:08.096 --> 00:01:10.055
Everyone! Li's back!

00:01:10.098 --> 00:01:12.100
Hang on, we're coming!
[GRUNTS]

00:01:12.144 --> 00:01:14.276
He made it! Whoo-hoo!

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.191
CUB 4: They made it!
Why are we running?

00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:17.802
CUB 5: Here we come!
CUB 6: He's back!

00:01:17.845 --> 00:01:19.717
They made it!

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.197
Li Shan is back!

00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:23.558
[PANDAS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY]

00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:27.420
[ALL PANTING]

00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:32.773
CUB 7: Hi!

00:01:32.817 --> 00:01:34.340
Everyone!

00:01:34.384 --> 00:01:36.603
Everyone, gather around!
This is my son!

00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:37.952
Hello, hi.
He's here!

00:01:37.996 --> 00:01:39.214
PANDA: You're here!
Triplets!

00:01:39.258 --> 00:01:41.042
Hi, I'm Ku Ku!

00:01:41.086 --> 00:01:42.304
I'm Meng Meng. I'm Shuai Shuai.

00:01:42.348 --> 00:01:44.132
Your fur is soft. He smells like cookies.

00:01:44.176 --> 00:01:47.309
He's so handsome,
just like his father.

00:01:47.353 --> 00:01:48.876
Thank you.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.052
Son, these are your cousins.

00:01:51.096 --> 00:01:52.577
Dim and Sum. [PO LAUGHS]

00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:53.707
I have cousins!

00:01:53.751 --> 00:01:54.969
Welcome! Welcome!

00:01:55.013 --> 00:01:56.667
Whoa! Buns on a string.

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.972
We call it a snacklace.

00:01:58.016 --> 00:01:59.235
DIM: That's right. [ALL CHOMPING]

00:01:59.539 --> 00:02:00.932
Uh... We'll make you
another one.

00:02:00.975 --> 00:02:02.194
Oh!

00:02:02.237 --> 00:02:03.891
It's you!

00:02:03.935 --> 00:02:06.328
So...That's nice.
Yeah, hi!

00:02:06.372 --> 00:02:08.505
I don't know who you are.

00:02:08.548 --> 00:02:10.855
Oh, Stripy Baby.
So beautiful.

00:02:10.898 --> 00:02:12.465
[LEI LEI GIGGLES]

00:02:12.509 --> 00:02:14.438
Oh! Okay, careful with that.
That's my action figure.

00:02:14.462 --> 00:02:16.034
Can I keep her? Can I?
No...

00:02:16.077 --> 00:02:17.728
[CRIES]

00:02:17.949 --> 00:02:19.385
...problem. Of course.

00:02:19.429 --> 00:02:20.766
Yeah.
That's why I brought her.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:21.909
Take good care of her.

00:02:21.953 --> 00:02:23.694
Yes! Stripy Baby.
[GIGGLES]

00:02:25.435 --> 00:02:29.003
You look just like me,
but a baby.

00:02:29.047 --> 00:02:30.483
[GIGGLES]

00:02:31.528 --> 00:02:35.009
[GASPS]
You're like me, but old.

00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:38.099
You're like me,
but fatter! [CHUCKLES]

00:02:38.143 --> 00:02:39.524
You're like me, but... [LAUGHING LOUDLY]

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:40.754
[WHIMPERS]

00:02:40.798 --> 00:02:41.929
...with a hat.

00:02:41.973 --> 00:02:43.235
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:02:43.278 --> 00:02:45.106
He does wear a hat!

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.499
You all look like me.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.895
Let's feast
in my son's honor.

00:02:50.938 --> 00:02:53.114
[ALL CHEERING]

00:02:53.158 --> 00:02:54.376
PO: What the...?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.126
Pandas don't walk.
We roll!

00:03:02.254 --> 00:03:04.332
Have you ever seen anyone
look so ridiculous?

00:03:04.355 --> 00:03:05.719
[LAUGHS]

00:03:06.127 --> 00:03:07.868
Po, what are you doing? Po!

00:03:07.912 --> 00:03:09.609
[GRUNTING]

00:03:11.089 --> 00:03:12.090
[CHUCKLES]

00:03:16.181 --> 00:03:17.835
[GROANING]

00:03:19.706 --> 00:03:22.883
Ohh! Ow!

00:03:22.927 --> 00:03:24.711
[GRUNTS] You're right,
that is better than walking.

00:03:24.755 --> 00:03:25.930
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:03:25.973 --> 00:03:27.584
ALL: Mmm!

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:29.934
Yeah, that's the good stuff.

00:03:29.977 --> 00:03:31.239
PANDA: Have some dumplings.

00:03:31.283 --> 00:03:33.411
What kind of panda
doesn't know how to roll?

00:03:33.414 --> 00:03:36.244
Well, I'm kind of new at this
whole "being a panda" thing.

00:03:36.288 --> 00:03:37.724
Hey, what kind of panda
are you?

00:03:37.768 --> 00:03:39.204
You have a funny neck.

00:03:39.247 --> 00:03:40.553
I'm not a panda at all.

00:03:40.597 --> 00:03:41.902
What's that? What's that?
My hat. My beak.

00:03:41.946 --> 00:03:42.990
What's that? My wing.

00:03:43.034 --> 00:03:44.688
What's that?
My dumplings.

00:03:44.731 --> 00:03:47.125
No more questions!
Go away, kid.

00:03:47.168 --> 00:03:48.561
Here, son.
I packed your chopsticks.

00:03:48.605 --> 00:03:49.910
Thanks, Dad. ALL: Wow.

00:03:49.954 --> 00:03:51.608
GRANDMA PANDA: Oh, my. What?

00:03:52.347 --> 00:03:53.871
What are those for?

00:03:53.914 --> 00:03:55.133
These?
These are chopsticks.

00:03:55.176 --> 00:03:56.177
They're for picking
up dumplings.

00:03:56.221 --> 00:03:59.038
You mean you only eat
one at a time?

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.706
Yummy. Yeah, yummy.

00:04:03.141 --> 00:04:04.229
[GASPS]

00:04:05.491 --> 00:04:07.754
I knew I wasn't eating
up to my potential!

00:04:07.798 --> 00:04:09.364
[GONG RINGING]

00:04:09.408 --> 00:04:11.105
[ALL CHEERING]

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.644
Huh?

00:04:22.247 --> 00:04:25.163
I am Mei Mei.

00:04:25.206 --> 00:04:28.340
Wow, she's amazing.
She's so beautiful.

00:04:28.383 --> 00:04:30.168
That's sweet, Po.

00:04:30.211 --> 00:04:32.474
But please, try to save
all other compliments

00:04:32.518 --> 00:04:34.271
until after
the performance.

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.254
Me? No, I didn't say...

00:04:37.268 --> 00:04:38.306
[SHUSHING]

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.265
Shut it.

00:04:40.308 --> 00:04:42.136
After the performance.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.790
Huh! Has it started yet?

00:04:44.704 --> 00:04:47.228
[ALL GASPING] [BOTH GRUNT]

00:04:47.272 --> 00:04:50.667
Best ribbon dancer
in the world! [CHUCKLES]

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.190
At least,
that's what she said.

00:04:52.233 --> 00:04:53.931
Look away. Look away.

00:04:53.974 --> 00:04:56.542
No. You can't, can you?

00:04:56.586 --> 00:04:58.849
Dad, why does she
keep staring at me like...

00:04:58.892 --> 00:04:59.980
[GASPS] that!

00:05:00.024 --> 00:05:01.329
Try to keep up.

00:05:01.373 --> 00:05:03.288
[GASPS] [ALL LAUGHING]

00:05:03.331 --> 00:05:05.029
I don't really know
how to dance!

00:05:05.072 --> 00:05:08.287
Of course you do.
All pandas dance.

00:05:09.033 --> 00:05:10.306
I know what
you were thinking.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.426
You do?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.472
[WHISPERING] "How can one
panda be so beautiful?"

00:05:13.515 --> 00:05:14.562
[CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY]

00:05:16.954 --> 00:05:19.043
For me? Oh!

00:05:19.086 --> 00:05:20.348
Ooh, ooh, ooh!

00:05:20.392 --> 00:05:21.923
Po.

00:05:21.987 --> 00:05:24.135
Help me, Dads.Yeah, no,
you're on your own.

00:05:24.178 --> 00:05:25.485
You're doing great, son.

00:05:27.355 --> 00:05:28.574
Your turn.

00:05:30.358 --> 00:05:31.559
[GROANS]

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.145
CROWD: Oh!

00:05:34.798 --> 00:05:36.105
[LAUGHS]

00:05:38.758 --> 00:05:39.890
Huh?

00:05:39.933 --> 00:05:41.892
[ALL CHEERING]

00:05:41.935 --> 00:05:43.154
Yay, Po!

00:05:44.111 --> 00:05:45.330
[GROANS] [LAUGHS]

00:05:45.373 --> 00:05:47.201
Don't worry.
You'll get the hang of it.

00:05:47.245 --> 00:05:48.362
[LAUGHING]

00:05:49.073 --> 00:05:50.814
I have so much to learn.

00:05:50.857 --> 00:05:52.032
[ALL CHEERING]

